  "sequenceRules": [
    "Two token buckets, both full at ready: a general bucket of bucketCapacity (40) tokens refilled at bucketRefillPerSecond (20) a second, and a store.set bucket of storeSetBucketCapacity (10) refilled at storeSetRefillPerSecond (10) a second.",
    "Refill is continuous, counted in whole milliseconds and kept in integer milli-tokens: each elapsed millisecond adds the refill rate in milli-tokens (20 for the general bucket, 10 for the store.set bucket), up to the capacity; a token is 1000 milli-tokens.",
    "Every message takes one general token; a store.set also takes one store.set token. A message is accepted only when every bucket it draws on holds a whole token. A refused message takes no token.",
    "Every refusal counts toward refusalsToClose (16) for the life of the mount; the refusal that reaches it closes the bridge."
  ],
